A||N||6||Cozmo||Directional wheels... which way??||||5||
Z||000000||Cozmo||12-08-2001||12:29 PM||||I just got a set of 15"x8" 5 spoke sawtooth directional wheels:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newwheel.jpg"> <BR>Which way are they "supposed" to go?<BR>Should they lean forward or backward? Was the original purpose to ventilate the brakes or be aerodynamically cleaner?<BR>Or was it just 'cuz they look cool <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B>Bob Cardone</B><BR><B>Suncoast Fieros</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thankssig.jpg">   <BR><B>'85 2M6 SE Targa</B>||||reg||5
Z||000001||LZeitgeist||12-08-2001||12:35 PM||||I think it's just 'cuz they look cool... try 'em both ways and see which way looks better to you...||||reg||1
Z||000002||Mach10||12-08-2001||01:19 PM||||Doesn't matter as long as both sides are consistant... HOWEVER, make sure the tread on the tires isn't directional. That would REALLY suck to mess up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000003||LZeitgeist||12-08-2001||02:42 PM||||Ooo.. good point, Mach10 - hadn't thought of that. <P>Yup, what he said.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000004||Formula88||12-08-2001||04:36 PM||||Well, those rims look directional for looks only.  IMO, I'd have them twisting backwards, like you have in the pic.  That flows with the lines, like the torque twisted the rims...  Twisting forwards looks weird, IMO.  <P>Some rims (84-? Corvette rims) are designed for brake cooling.  If the wheels are indeed directional, there should be an indicator on the wheel showing you which way they rotate, just like directional tires.||||reg||1
Z||000005||rogergarrison||12-08-2001||06:00 PM||||its really your choice. but the manufacturer would have them the way the rear one standing next to car is. but look on the tires for arrow before you mount them. Arrow goes in wheel rotation direction.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cozmo||12-08-2001||06:16 PM||||The rims have no markings showing rotation direction.  The tires that came on them were junk, so they get new tires after I've refinished them.<BR>Most of the people who have seen them think they will look better rotating "backwards".<BR>BobC||||reg||1
